  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Next Phase Nature Based Solutions Pilot in the North Manilla Bay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment focuses on generating a series of profiles (drawings), a comprehensive cost estimate, and addressing legal aspects crucial for contractors to determine their pricing for project realisation. Specific attention needs to be given to the operation and maintenance of the pilots. The specified locations are situated in the municipality of Malolos within the Northern Manila Bay coastal area of the Philippines. This initiative represents a critical advancement in the &apos;Reduce Exposure to Flooding&apos; priority measures outlined in the Manila Bay Sustainable Development Master Plan (MBSDMP).</narrative>
  </description>
